# The build context is only what the Dockerfiles COPY (docker/Dockerfile.*,
# built with the repo root as context). Everything else stays out: .git, tests/,
# docs/, local environments and agent scratch directories. A new COPY of anything
# not listed here fails with "not found"; add it below.
*
!docker/
!src/
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE

# Build and editor artifacts inside those. Patterns match relative to the context
# root, so a bare `__pycache__` or `*.pyc` matches only at the top level.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
